GameTDB data
============

The *.tsv.gz files here are GameTDB's English game information for the Wii U, 3DS, DS
and Switch (descriptions, developers, publishers, release dates, genres, players,
ratings), made by tools/render-gametdb.py from the databases at https://www.gametdb.com
(wiiutdb.zip, 3dstdb.zip, dstdb.zip, switchtdb.zip). The information belongs to GameTDB
and its contributors, and the app credits them.

GameTDB's terms for redistributing its databases are not vendored in this repository and
have not been confirmed here: they are to be confirmed against https://www.gametdb.com
(see its "Terms of use" / licence page) before a release relies on this data. If GameTDB
objects, remove these files and run the tool for a build that needs no network.
